	(text "RADIO-004: U4 TPS22917DBVT / radio power gating\nQOD tied to VOUT: Rdis = 150 ohm TYPICAL.\nC45+C46 = 0.1+10 = 10.1 uF nominal external load.\nt90..10 = ln(9)*150*10.1u = 3.329 ms (ideal RC).\nNot a guaranteed off-time: module C/load and VIN decay matter.\nCT capacitor must return to VIN, not GND; rating >= 7 V.\nVIN, ON, CT and reset/isolation integration remain incomplete.\nMath + limits: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-004-radio-load-switch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-004-radio-load-switch")
		)
		(uuid "6ee9ae5e-64a4-457a-b04f-1c82cf26dbc0")
	)
	(text "RADIO-003: C46 bulk bypass / TDK C3216X7R1V106K160AC\n10 uF nominal, +/-10%, X7R; DC bias reduces capacitance.\nC(3.3 V) = 9.69875 + (3.3-3.15)/0.85*(9.38950-9.69875)\n             = 9.64418 uF; C(3.6 V) = 9.53503 uF (nominal).\nSource curve interpolation, NOT a guaranteed minimum.\nRail: 3.0..3.6 V; source capability >= 0.5 A.\nSupply and transmit transient qualification remain required.\nCalculations: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-003-bulk-capacitance"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.446 93.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-003-bulk-capacitance")
		)
		(uuid "73b39401-7019-496b-9457-6f1577917331")
	)
